  },
  {
    "source_pdf": "sample4.pdf",
    "page": null,
    "line_order": 48,
    "text": "All data will be stored on the research group RAID server, which may be made available in a shared folder upon request. Depending on the type of data, specific software may be needed to read propietary file formats. Such details will be explained if requested. There should not be any delay or embargo periods on the data acquired for this research. If there is, this data management plan will be updated.",
    "label": "content",
    "document_format": "docling_markdown",
    "extractor": "docling"
  },
  {
    "source_pdf": "sample4.pdf",
    "page": null,
